@format fwcollab.symbol_map.v3
@id HG-007
@title held-out layout paired with V4-L5-011; fixed-reflection crate light door
@max_steps 1
@controller c1_plate plate at 3,5 accepts F
@actuator a1_platform platform at 7,9 controlled_by all(c1_plate)
@controller c2_toggle toggle at 6,14
@actuator a2_platform platform at 2,18 controlled_by all(c2_toggle)
@controller c3_lever lever at 3,23
@controller c4_plate plate at 1,24 accepts F
@actuator a3_door door at 7,27 controlled_by all(c3_lever,c4_plate)
@controller c5_plate plate at 6,32 accepts W
@actuator a4_door door at 2,36 controlled_by all(c5_plate)
@controller c6_plate plate at 3,41 accepts F
@actuator a5_platform platform at 7,45 controlled_by all(c6_plate)
@light + direction RIGHT sensor S opens A
